t-weight=\"600\">工厂客户</text><text x=\"967.5\" y=\"182.0\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">提供设备与作业现场</text></g><path data-from=\"maker\" data-to=\"service\" d=\"M275 58 H345 V130 H435 l-8 -5 m8 5 l-8 5\" stroke=\"#173f58\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path data-from=\"parts\" data-to=\"service\" d=\"M275 163 H435 l-8 -5 m8 5 l-8 5\" stroke=\"#173f58\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path data-from=\"software\" data-to=\"service\" d=\"M275 268 H345 V190 H435 l-8 -5 m8 5 l-8 5\" stroke=\"#173f58\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">技术资料</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">维修备件</text><text x=\"353\" y=\"289\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">诊断工具</text><path data-from=\"service\" data-to=\"client\" d=\"M700 148 H855 l-8 -5 m8 5 l-8 5\" stroke=\"#238b92\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"777\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#238b92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">维护交付</text><path data-from=\"client\" data-to=\"service\" d=\"M967 210 V264 H568 V210 l-5 8 m5 -8 l5 8\" stroke=\"#b48a50\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"767\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#b48a50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">工单需求与完工验收</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#607681\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">模拟来源：本示例册虚构的设备维护服务企业设定；仅用于图式演示。</text></svg><figcaption><p class=\"gallery-caption\">设备维护服务企业将制造商资料、备件和诊断工具组合为现场服务，工厂客户通过工单提出需求并确认维护结果。</p><p class=\"gallery-caption\">产业链图表达企业的投入与交付依赖，节点大