      "section": "商业关系图示例｜企业设定与数据均为模拟",
      "title": "设备维护服务企业：组织层级与工单管理职责",
      "lead": "模拟企业由总经理统筹三个职能组，运营调度组管理现场维护与远程诊断小组，使工单执行归口一致。",
      "layout": "gallery-rel-structure",
      "body": "<figure class=\"gallery-rel\" id=\"rel-organization-tree\" data-visual=\"structure\" data-source=\"模拟来源：本示例册虚构的设备维护服务企业设定；仅用于图式演示。\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 330\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"rel-organization-tree\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Microsoft YaHei, 微软雅黑, sans-serif\"><g data-node=\"general\"><rect x=\"430\" y=\"8\" width=\"240\" height=\"58\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#edf4f6\" stroke=\"#cfdee4\"/><text x=\"550.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">总经理</text><text x=\"550.0\" y=\"59.0\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">统筹经营与资源</text></g><g data-node=\"contracts\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"123\" width=\"240\" height=\"65\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#edf4f6\" stroke=\"#cfdee4\"/><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"150.5\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">客户与合同组</text><text x=\"170.0\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">负责报价、续约和回款</text></g><g data-node=\"dispatch\"><rect x=\"430\" y=\"123\" width=\"240\" height=\"65\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#173f58\" stroke=\"#173f58\"/><text x=\"550.0\" y=\"150.5\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">运营调度组</text><text x=\"550.0\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">统筹工单、人员和质量</text></g><g data-node=\"technical\"><rect x=\"810\" y=\"123\" width=\"240\" height=\"65\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#edf4f6\" stroke=\"#cfdee4\"/><text x=\"930.0\" y=\"150.5\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">技术与备件组</text><text x=\"930.0\" y=\"177.5\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">维护标准并管理备件</text></g><g data-node=\"onsite\"><rect x=\"328\" y=\"237\" width=\"212\" height=\"62\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#edf4f6\" stroke=\"#cfdee4\"/><text x=\"434.0\" y=\"263.0\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">现场维护小组</text><text x=\"434.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">执行维护并上传记录</text></g><g data-node=\"remote\"><rect x=\"568\" y=\"237\" width=\"212\" height=\"62\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#edf4f6\" stroke=\"#cfdee4\"/><text x=\"674.0\" y=\"263.0\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">远程诊断小组</text><text x=\"674.0\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#173f58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"400\">判断故障并提出方案</text></g><path data-from=\"general\" data-to=\"contracts\" d=\"M550 66 V94 H170 V123 l-5 -8 m5 8 l5 -8\" stroke=\"#173f58\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path data-from=\"general\" data-to=\"dispatch\" d=\"M550 66 V123 l-5 -8 m5 8 l5 -8\" stroke=\"#173f58\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path data-from=\"general\" data-to=\"technical\" d=\"M550 66 V94 H930 V123 l-5 -8 m5 8 l5 -8\" stroke=\"#173f58\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path data-from=\"dispatch\" data-to=\"onsite\" d=\"M550 188 V212 H434 V237 l-5 -8 m5 8 l5 -8\" stroke=\"#238b92\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path data-from=\"dispatch\" data-to=\"remote\" d=\"M550 188 V212 H674 V237 l-5 -8 m5 8 l5 -8\" stroke=\"#238b92\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"0\" y=\"324\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#607681\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\">模拟来源：本示例册虚构的设备维护服务企业设定；仅用于图式演示。</text></svg><figcaption><p class=\"gallery-caption\">总经理分别管理客户与合同、运营调度、技术与备件三个职能组；运营调度组对两类执行小组安排工单并核对结果。</p><p class=\"gallery-caption\">树状连线表示模拟企业的直接汇报关系，各节点同时标明主要职责；外部供应商和工厂客户不纳入这张组织层级图。</p></figcaption></figure>",
      "visual_plan": {
        "relation": "structure",
